## Control Structures

### If/Else Statements

```php
<?php
$age = 20;

if ($age < 13) {
    echo "Child";
} elseif ($age < 18) {
    echo "Teenager";
} elseif ($age < 65) {
    echo "Adult";
} else {
    echo "Senior";
}

// Alternative syntax (for templates)
<?php if ($age >= 18): ?>
    <p>You are an adult</p>
<?php endif; ?>
?>
```

### Switch Statement

```php
<?php
$day = 2;

switch ($day) {
    case 1:
        echo "Monday";
        break;          // Important!
    case 2:
        echo "Tuesday";
        break;
    case 3:
    case 4:             // Fall through
        echo "Wed or Thu";
        break;
    default:
        echo "Other day";
}

// Matches better than switch (PHP 8+)
$message = match($day) {
    1 => "Monday",
    2 => "Tuesday",
    3, 4 => "Wed or Thu",
    default => "Other"
};
?>
```

### Loops

**While Loop:**
```php
<?php
$i = 0;
while ($i < 5) {
    echo $i;
    $i++;
}

// Do-while (executes at least once)
$i = 0;
do {
    echo $i;
    $i++;
} while ($i < 5);
?>
```

**For Loop:**
```php
<?php
for ($i = 0; $i < 5; $i++) {
    echo $i;
}

// Multiple expressions
for ($i = 0, $j = 10; $i < 5; $i++, $j--) {
    echo "$i, $j ";
}

// Alternative syntax
<?php for ($i = 0; $i < 5; $i++): ?>
    <p><?php echo $i; ?></p>
<?php endfor; ?>
?>
```

**Foreach Loop:**
```php
<?php
$colors = ["Red", "Green", "Blue"];

// Indexed array
foreach ($colors as $color) {
    echo $color . " ";
}

// Associative array
$person = ["name" => "John", "age" => 30];
foreach ($person as $key => $value) {
    echo "$key: $value\n";
}

// Modify array elements
$numbers = [1, 2, 3];
foreach ($numbers as &$num) {  // Reference
    $num *= 2;
}
unset($num);                   // Unset reference
// $numbers = [2, 4, 6]
?>
```

### Break and Continue

```php
<?php
for ($i = 0; $i < 10; $i++) {
    if ($i == 3) {
        continue;               // Skip to next iteration
    }
    if ($i == 7) {
        break;                  // Exit loop
    }
    echo $i . " ";              // 0 1 2 4 5 6
}

// Break nested loops
for ($i = 0; $i < 3; $i++) {
    for ($j = 0; $j < 3; $j++) {
        if ($i == 1 && $j == 1) {
            break 2;            // Break 2 levels
        }
    }
}
?>
```

