## Error Handling

### Try-Catch-Finally

```php
<?php
try {
    // Code that might throw exception
    if ($divisor == 0) {
        throw new Exception("Division by zero");
    }
    $result = 10 / $divisor;
} catch (Exception $e) {
    // Handle exception
    echo "Error: " . $e->getMessage();
} finally {
    // Always executes
    echo "Done";
}

// Multiple catches
try {
    // Code
} catch (PDOException $e) {
    echo "Database error: " . $e->getMessage();
} catch (Exception $e) {
    echo "General error: " . $e->getMessage();
}
?>
```

### Custom Exceptions

