**When to use:** Multiple algorithms, sorting/filtering variations, encryption methods

### Pattern 6: Dependency Injection

```php
<?php
// Problem: Create flexible, testable code
// Bad: Class creates its dependencies
class OrderService {
    private $emailService;
    
    public function __construct() {
        $this->emailService = new EmailService();  // Tightly coupled
    }
}

