### Array Functions & Techniques

```php
<?php
// Array reduction/aggregation
$numbers = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5];
$sum = array_reduce($numbers, fn($carry, $item) => $carry + $item, 0);  // 15
$product = array_reduce($numbers, fn($carry, $item) => $carry * $item, 1);  // 120

// Array transformation chain
$data = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6];
$result = array_map(fn($x) => $x * 2, 
           array_filter($data, fn($x) => $x % 2 == 0));
