### Problem 1: Remove Duplicates from Array (maintain order)

```php
<?php
// Keep first occurrence, remove duplicates
function removeDuplicates($array) {
    $seen = [];
    $result = [];
    
    foreach ($array as $item) {
        if (!in_array($item, $seen)) {
            $seen[] = $item;
            $result[] = $item;
        }
    }
    
    return $result;
}

// Better with array_unique
$array = [1, 2, 2, 3, 1, 4];
$unique = array_unique($array);  // [1, 2, 3, 4]

// Test
echo removeDuplicates([1, 2, 2, 3, 1, 4]);  // [1, 2, 3, 4]
?>
```

### Problem 2: Reverse String Without Reversing Words

